      "url": "https://airandspace.si.edu/stories/editorial/mars-project-wernher-von-braun-science-fiction-writer",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"fef88f1b391ec8ca\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOne editor commented: “Somewhere in this pulpy mass are the seeds of a good piece of science fiction, but I’m darned if I can get at them.” Something like 18 publishers rejected the book. Soon, a disappointed von Braun was consumed by the Army rocket development’s move to Huntsville, Alabama, followed by the sudden outbreak of the Korean War, which led to an urgent project to build the nuclear-armed Redstone ballistic missile.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"fef88f1b391ec8ca\">>>",
